      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i have a killer headache and a fever. i need to take some tylenol but im just double checking the max dose. i had hep c a few years ago but it's been totally cleared/resolved so i dont think it matters anymore. is it safe to just take 1000mg every 4 hours if i really need it?",
